You are working on my existing project, **MARSNAV: AI-Powered Terrain Analysis and Rover Navigation**, developed for the NASA Space Apps Challenge, “Interplanetary Survival Guide: Martian Map.”

Your task is to **audit, repair, upgrade, and complete the existing application** so it becomes a scientifically grounded Mars terrain analysis and human Marswalk route-planning system.

