Before changing anything, inspect the entire existing codebase, components, routes, data services, backend, state management, APIs, map/3D renderer, image-processing pipeline, route algorithms, and current feature implementations.

For EVERY feature below:

- If it already exists and works with genuine data, preserve it and improve its reliability, accuracy, usability, and integration.
